                                "sense_id": "4d8c7fe5-c6f2-3067-96c8-47bc3e960d8c",
                                "text": "They, of course, would change, but not again could she; henceforth no music for her in the Bush birds' minstrelsy, no pleasure in rivalry with buttercups for the butterflies' kiss."
